WEBVTT

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:16.220
Akoya has taken the law
into his own hands

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.060
and executed people he regards as evil,
calling it the enforcement of justice.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.520
SHUNKA HIYAMA
WAKASA LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:27.360
He's been doing it all to realize
his ideal world where there's no evil.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.570
<i>His progress was going well.</i>

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:37.200
<i>But the process of fighting evil</i>
<i>has gradually changed him.</i>

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.120
<i>He's been trapped...</i>

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.080
<i>in the temptation of murder.</i>

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:49.380
Since then, he has asked me
for directions in kengan matches.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:51.960
You mean you're his brakes?

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:53.260
ADAM DUDLEY
(ELIMINATED)

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.510
<i>He bit Imai's thigh off!</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:02.430
<i>Did that rupture the artery?</i>
<i>He's bleeding massively!</i>

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:08.110
<i>Akoya is chewing on his flesh.</i>
<i>Is that to provoke him?</i>

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:10.230
SEISHU AKOYA
WAKASA LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:12.360
JERRY TYSON
(ELIMINATED)

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.740
I think I'm going to throw up.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:15.950
SAYAKA KATAHARA

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:19.160
You're bleeding severely.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:20.780
Stem the bleeding.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:22.700
You are not allowed to die yet.

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:23.660
COSMO IMAI

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:26.620
You must learn with your own body...

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:31.130
what justice is.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:06.970
DEATH MATCH

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:08.520
AKIRA NISHIHONJI

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.310
Calm down, Cos. Don't take the bait.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.310
Cos?

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.480
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:19.360
<i>I can't...</i>

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.450
<i>stop shaking!</i>

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.660
Evil one,

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:27.290
experience it firsthand.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:31.330
Let justice embrace you and die in fear.

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:35.380
<i>Those who are determined</i>
<i>to become martyr for their faith...</i>

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:38.420
<i>radiate a certain aura.</i>

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:42.260
<i>The terror can sometimes transcend</i>
<i>life and death.</i>

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:48.810
<i>Even risking one's own life</i>
<i>is nothing compared to this terror.</i>

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:54.770
<i>Cosmo Imai, who was caught up in this</i>
<i>unexpectedly, wasn't prepared for this.</i>

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.910
Let me tell you...

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:08.660
what justice means.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.250
Wait! I'll surrend--

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.830
Stop talking or you'll bite your tongue.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.970
I'm putting pressure on
your intercostal nerves.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.390
The pain is beyond description, isn't it?

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:31.270
Do you understand, Cosmo Imai?

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:33.980
This is the pain of the virtuous people.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:38.190
It is always the well-doers
who are oppressed throughout history.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.190
The wrongdoers prosper...

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.530
and ruin the world.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.320
Incorrigible.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:46.240
Incorrigible!

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.330
Lost consciousness?

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.630
You are not allowed to pass out.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.130
There are 12 pairs of ribs.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.920
Now 23 ribs are left.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:08.140
You should slowly understand...

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.470
what justice should be.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.480
Your sins will be purified
with your painful death

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:18.150
and your soul will be righteous.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.570
Now, here goes the second rib.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.320
-Stop it!
<i>-It's terrible.</i>

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:28.570
<i>This isn't a battle anymore,</i>
<i>but a torture!</i>

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:30.460
What's the referee doing?

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.370
JUN SEKIBAYASHI
HARUO KOHNO (ELIMINATED)

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.040
If the match continues, he'll die!

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:37.370
<i>I'd stop him if I could.</i>
<i>But I can't!</i>

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:41.630
<i>Unless the fighter is clearly</i>
<i>unable to continue the match...</i>

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.760
<i>or shows a clear intent to surrender,</i>
<i>I'm not allowed to stop it.</i>

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:50.470
<i>A referee can't make</i>
<i>these decisions lightly...</i>

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:55.520
<i>as long as there are corporations'</i>
<i>reputation and profits on the line.</i>

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:59.060
Hey! Throw the match now!

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:00.980
Or I'll kill you!

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:03.070
It's too late.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.610
No one can stop Akoya now.

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.740
If he finds out I forfeited...

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:11.450
<i>Akoya will kill Cosmo Imai.</i>

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.990
<i>And until the end of his life,</i>

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:18.120
he will continue slaughtering people.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:22.380
Calm down, Adam.
Cos hasn't lost this match yet.

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:26.050
Are you nuts?

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:28.300
Imai is going to get killed!

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:31.640
He's risking his life for you!

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:35.520
Don't you have a heart?

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:38.810
I think you got it wrong.

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:44.020
You didn't think I was a good person,
did you?

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.860
I pulled a young man with a bright future
into the underworld...

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:51.070
and made him face a deadly crisis.

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:53.620
And you still think I have a good heart?

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.200
Mister.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:07:00.790
No matter what it takes, I will definitely
become the Kengan Association chairman.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.290
Every ambition comes along
with sacrifices.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:06.170
So...

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:08.800
shut up now.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:18.480
<i>He broke the fourth...</i>
<i>or wait, was it the third bone?</i>

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:21.900
<i>Maybe this is it.</i>

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:24.690
<i>I'm sorry, Bro.</i>

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:28.400
<i>It seems I'm going to lose.</i>

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:32.530
<i>I'm sorry, Master.</i>

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:37.450
<i>Another win for me!</i>

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:42.920
<i>Huh?</i>

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:47.170
<i>Am I in my gym?</i>

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:50.800
<i>That means...</i>

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:55.010
<i>You've got a long way to go, Cosmo.</i>

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:57.350
<i>Master?</i>

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:02.690
<i>At this rate,</i>
<i>you're never going to take me down.</i>

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.400
MITSUYO KUREISHI
MMA FIGHTER

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:06.190
<i>Master.</i>

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:09.860
<i>Cosmo, do you like fighting?</i>

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:11.990
<i>Well...</i>

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.610
<i>It sure sucks to lose,</i>

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.370
<i>but it's pretty fun to fight.</i>

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:20.200
<i>Besides, I have a goal</i>
<i>to surpass you one day.</i>

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.870
<i>Uh-huh. I see.</i>

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:27.210
<i>Okay. You're never going to beat me.</i>

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:29.670
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.170
<i>Isn't a master supposed</i>
<i>to motivate his pupil?</i>

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.090
<i>Relax.</i>

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:37.470
<i>Let me add one thing.</i>

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:43.270
<i>You're never going to beat me</i>
<i>as long as you stay where you are now.</i>

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.810
<i>I'm not your guardian.</i>

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:52.400
<i>Figure out what that means on your own.</i>

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.280
You still resist?

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:00.740
Wha...!

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.830
<i>Akoya got out of his mount!</i>

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:07.380
<i>He tried to attack my testicles.</i>

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:09.340
<i>Incomprehensible.</i>

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:14.090
<i>I've never seen Cosmo Imai fight this way.</i>

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:18.550
<i>Impudent!</i>

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:23.310
<i>Is his adrenaline decreasing the pain?</i>

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:25.190
<i>But this is incomprehensible.</i>

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:27.810
<i>He came at my punch to grab my arm...</i>

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.020
<i>and attempted to break it</i>
<i>without hesitation.</i>

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:35.360
<i>Neither of these are the tactics</i>
<i>of the Cosmo Imai I know.</i>

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:39.410
<i>What has changed in him?</i>

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.580
<i>I figured it out, Master.</i>

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.580
<i>I had it all wrong.</i>

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.000
<i>It's pretty fun to fight.</i>

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.590
<i>Besides, I have a goal</i>
<i>to surpass you one day.</i>

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:56.930
<i>It's wrong!</i>

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.640
<i>There's no next time if I lose.</i>

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.220
<i>A left middle kick!</i>

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:06.730
<i>It got right into his broken ribs!</i>

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:10.610
He's not falling.

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:14.690
<i>Something really has changed...</i>

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:17.200
<i>in him.</i>

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:20.570
I finally got it now.

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:24.990
I don't like fighting, do I?

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:28.870
What I like isn't fighting.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:31.080
What I like is...

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.880
winning!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.180
<i>I see.</i>

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:47.480
<i>You still dare to resist justice.</i>

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:52.020
<i>That leaves your soul</i>
<i>no room for salvation.</i>

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:55.020
I'm going to win. I will!

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.490
He's fast!

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:01.530
<i>His reflexes improved?</i>

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:05.740
<i>Inconceivable. His fighting spirit</i>
<i>should have been broken.</i>

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.870
<i>What is driving this man?</i>

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:13.790
He evolved at the last moment.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.670
Master.

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:17.840
What is that boy?

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:20.680
Huh? Can't you see?

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:23.470
<i>He's just a genius.</i>

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:30.060
<i>I'm hitting him!</i>
<i>My attacks are hurting him.</i>

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:32.810
<i>He's not a monster. He's a human.</i>

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:35.610
<i>If he's a human, then I can beat him!</i>

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:44.240
<i>Though he lost the contact with Hiyama,</i>
<i>he's still incredibly fast.</i>

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:46.330
<i>What a monster.</i>

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.870
I won't kill you right away.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:55.000
Once you realize the guilt of your sins,
I will beat you to death.

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:58.130
Know what justice--

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:03.590
<i>How impudent!</i>

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.300
<i>Absurd!</i>

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:08.640
<i>Your evil tricks are nothing to me.</i>

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:10.980
What?

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.150
PYTHON HOLD

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:15.150
Nice one!

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:17.770
He used the damn referee!

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:20.610
<i>Yes! Good! This is the last chance.</i>

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:23.030
<i>Go get him, Cos!</i>

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.200
Absurd!

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:26.820
<i>He's not falling?</i>

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:35.960
<i>Akoya's slamming Imai against the wall!</i>

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:39.050
<i>This could kill Imai!</i>

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.880
No, not yet!

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:44.380
Imai's not loosening
his sleeper hold at all!

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:53.310
<i>Master, Brother, Adam...</i>

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:59.480
<i>I promise I'll win.</i>

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:01.650
<i>Just wait...</i>

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.490
<i>a little longer.</i>

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:15.500
<i>He's off!</i>

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:20.210
<i>Akoya's finally escaped</i>
<i>Imai's sleeper hold.</i>

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.720
I will execute justice...

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:28.680
in the name of justice!

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.230
I'm not letting you go this time.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:38.770
<i>Zone!</i>

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:40.900
<i>He still has energy for that?</i>

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:43.360
<i>Absurd!</i>

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.360
<i>The pain's coming back.</i>

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.580
<i>This is excruciating!</i>

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:56.870
<i>He's delivering blow after blow</i>
<i>to his broken ribs.</i>

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:02.550
<i>We can see the pain on Cosmo's face,</i>
<i>but he's holding on to him.</i>

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:05.300
<i>If I let him go, I will lose.</i>

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:08.550
<i>I won't let him go</i>
<i>even if my arm gets torn off.</i>

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:11.680
<i>Impudent! Impudent!</i>

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:14.060
<i>Now that it has come to this...</i>

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:19.650
I am the King of Stranglers,
Cosmo Imai!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.570
NAOYA OKUBO
RYO HIMURO

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:34.330
SUKIZO URITA
RYO INABA

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:42.170
See, Haruo? Told ya.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.130
He is a genius.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:46.710
We have a winner!

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:50.680
The winner is Cosmo Imai.

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:10.660
You were strong.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:14.530
What do you want?

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:20.670
Akoya, I don't think anyone doubts
how strong you are.

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:24.960
You were better than Cos in every way.

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:29.340
In fact, even though you lost,
you only suffered minor damage.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:34.140
On the other hand, Cos won
and is severely injured.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:38.890
If you had followed
Miss Hiyama's orders...

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:43.730
if you had tried to win
from the beginning...

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:49.070
if you hadn't been driven
by your killer impulses...

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.030
you would have been the winner.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.950
But Cos won.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:58.580
That's the result and that is everything.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.660
<i>Dude, that's a harsh comment.</i>

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.670
<i>I don't hate it though.</i>

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:05.170
Akoya.

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:07.630
Thank you.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:14.220
Fighting you made me realize
that I'd been misguided.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:17.140
Fighting is scary.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:21.600
There is no room for fun
in a real fight.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:23.770
<i>It's a battlefield</i>

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:28.150
<i>where the slightest inattention</i>
<i>or judgment error can cost you your life.</i>

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:33.910
I had never felt scared to fight
until I fought you.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:35.280
But...

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:40.450
I want to fight you again.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.830
Let's go, Hiyama.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:49.380
Akoya.

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:52.630
Not everyone can understand each other.

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:56.890
There are some people
who can only live in their own way.

00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:59.970
What do you think is going
to happen to them?

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:03.230
A bright future probably
doesn't await them.

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:07.480
They will continue on
the cycle of killing until they die.

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:09.610
That's it.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:14.860
A man who's a slave to murder and
a woman who can only cling to him.

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:17.700
Pitiful, isn't it?

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:20.870
I am grateful for him.

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:25.960
Thanks to him,
I feel like I figured something out.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:28.250
Watch me, Bro.

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:32.760
I'm going to become even stronger.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:37.930
COSMO IMAI
ADVANCES TO THE THIRD STAGE

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:44.810
<i>It's coming.</i>

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:48.730
<i>Ohma's match is starting soon.</i>

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:50.860
KAZUO YAMASHITA

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:52.860
<i>My entire fortune is at stake.</i>

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:55.280
<i>What if we lose?</i>

00:17:56.780 --> 00:17:59.030
<i>If Ohma doesn't win...</i>

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:03.540
<i>I'd lose my job, home, and everything.</i>

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:04.910
Hey.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:08.420
-There you are.
-Ohma.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:12.920
I'm up soon. Aren't you going to watch it?

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.800
Oh, yeah. It's about time.

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:18.470
What're you doing out here?

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.340
Well...

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:23.010
I was lost in thought.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.180
I'm disgusted with myself.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:32.060
I'm full of myself even though
you're the one who fights.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:34.530
OHMA TOKITA
FIGHTER YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:38.360
I hate how small I am.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:41.820
Kazuo Yamashita.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.290
You are my employer.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.000
Just trust me and be confident.

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:50.500
I will definitely...

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:52.710
<i>You are weak.</i>

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:54.840
I will definitely...

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:59.470
Excuse me, gentlemen.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:03.720
ERIO KURE
PATRIARCH OF THE KURE FAMILY

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:05.430
Sure.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:07.310
How may I help you?

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:08.730
Who the hell are--

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:19.950
RAIAN KURE

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.160
What's up, shithead?

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:24.910
Mr. Yamashita,

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:28.450
would you care to play a game with me?

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:31.170
A game? With you?

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:32.500
Correct.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:35.540
The prize is your oldest son,

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:38.920
Kenzo Yamashita's life.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.010
What!

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:44.930
Why would they want your kid?

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:48.930
I have no idea what is going on.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.900
Oh, Mr. Yamashita.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:59.570
You don't know what your own son's
been doing for the past ten years.

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:00.530
Huh?

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:05.160
Your adversary's company,
Under Mount, Inc., was founded

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:06.660
by Kenzo Yamashita.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:07.830
KENZO YAMASHITA

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:10.080
What? Kenzo did?

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:13.290
What about Mr. Ohta, the president?

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.330
He's just a puppet,

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:20.760
although Ohta is the one who holds
membership with the Kengan Association.

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:24.590
Kenzo brought the company to
what it is today,

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:30.270
without making a public appearance
by using Ohta as a cover.

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:34.600
I believe he had to use
some tough measures.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:37.060
No way.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:40.110
But that is none of my concern.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:44.780
The problem is that the man deceived...

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:49.080
no, that he believes he deceived us.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:52.870
He underestimates us.

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:57.290
That brat thinks he's the mastermind
and is leading the Kure Family by the nose

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:00.760
and the kengan matches,

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:05.050
where a lot of blood has been shed
for companies' reputation and profits.

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:12.730
He has done enough.
We can no longer stand by and watch.

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:14.520
However,

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:19.770
we undertake any sort of job
as long as they pay adequately.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:26.570
Hence, we have no objection
to fight for Under Mount, Inc.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:31.660
That's how seriously we take the contract.

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:36.460
Of course, eliminating our employer
is the last thing we would do.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:43.260
Then again, the man doesn't have anything
to do with the company on paper.

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:46.510
It won't be a problem to kill him.

00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:50.390
However, I am benevolent.

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.220
Ohma Tokita.

00:21:53.140 --> 00:21:56.810
If you could take Raian down,

00:21:57.350 --> 00:22:00.560
I will spare your employer's son.

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:03.780
So, that's the deal.

00:22:04.110 --> 00:22:07.400
I don't give a shit
as long as I get to murder, though.

00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:13.870
You're lucky, pops.
It's a win-win deal for you, isn't it?

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:16.580
Even if you lose,

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:20.880
you get to dispose of your trash,
the bad debt, for free.

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:23.800
Pretty good deal, don't you think?

00:22:24.050 --> 00:22:26.550
T... Trash?

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:32.100
Take it back.

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:38.520
Kenzo, my son, is not trash!

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:40.730
Take it back!

00:22:42.400 --> 00:22:45.230
Who are you to call him your son?

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:49.570
You've done nothing for him
for the past ten years.

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:55.790
<i>Just be honest.</i>
<i>I know you also think this way.</i>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:00.540
<i>"What a piece of trash.</i>
<i>I wish he'd just die soon."</i>

00:23:01.790 --> 00:23:02.750
<i>No!</i>

00:23:02.880 --> 00:23:05.210
<i>"He's ruining my life."</i>

00:23:05.590 --> 00:23:07.460
<i>"That idiot is not my son."</i>

00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:10.430
<i>"What a failure did I raise?"</i>

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:12.340
<i>"I can't wait for him to die."</i>

00:23:14.140 --> 00:23:15.600
<i>No! You're wrong!</i>

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:20.270
<i>I guess the apple doesn't fall</i>
<i>far from the tree.</i>

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:23.360
<i>You actually wish your own son's death!</i>

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:26.690
<i>No! Stop!</i>

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:31.610
Ohma?

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:34.240
Don't listen to him, Kazuo Yamashita.

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:36.990
You think you're intimidating us?

00:23:38.290 --> 00:23:41.750
Is the Kure Family's forte
to talk shit and not to fight?

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:45.920
Your bark is bigger than your bite.

00:23:48.050 --> 00:23:50.130
I think that's enough for now.

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:53.180
Save it for the showdown.

00:23:53.970 --> 00:23:58.850
Mr. Yamashita, I look forward to
a good match.

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:07.150
PREVIEW

00:24:07.230 --> 00:24:10.990
<i>How will Kazuo Yamashita play</i>
<i>the nefarious hostage game?</i>

00:24:11.070 --> 00:24:12.820
<i>The Niko Style versus the Kure Family.</i>

00:24:12.910 --> 00:24:16.160
<i>The battle begins at last!</i>
<i>Ridiculously strong!</i>

00:24:16.410 --> 00:24:18.790
<i>Fight, fight, and fight!</i>

00:24:18.910 --> 00:24:19.910
<i>Next episode: "Devil."</i>

00:24:20.060 --> 00:24:22.040
Subtitle translation by Miki Miyaji
